# FIREBASE_APPLET_CONFIG_JSON: Full JSON string of your Firebase web config
# (includes projectId, appId, apiKey, authDomain, firestoreDatabaseId, storageBucket, messagingSenderId, measurementId).
# Note: Individual VITE_FIREBASE_* and VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID env vars are also supported optionally as overrides.
FIREBASE_APPLET_CONFIG_JSON=""

